OL,3,GNEWSAFlock of white doves make surprise
OL,4,Ahome in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have described their surprise
OL,7,Fafter a huge flock of white doves have
OL,8,Fapparently settled and become a feature
OL,9,Fof their picturesque Lancashire
OL,10,Fvillage.
OL,12,FDunsop Bridge in the Ribble Valley has
OL,13,Fbeen known for generations as a popular
OL,14,Fplace to feed the ducks.
OL,16,FHowever, the place has been taken over
OL,17,Fby dozens of the doves, with rumours in
OL,18,Fthe village suggesting they may have
OL,19,Fbeen released or escaped when a local
OL,20,Fbird-keeper left the area.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
