OL,3,GNEWSAFlock of white doves make surprise
OL,4,Ahome in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FConnor Pickering, co-owner of
OL,7,FPuddleducks cafe, said the doves have
OL,8,Fbred and the flock has now increased in
OL,9,Fsize to about 90.
